        "\"Check Status\" authenticated with httpHeaderAuth in the original; add the matching Authorization header (or use the service's connector).",
        "\"Get Image Result URL\" authenticated with httpHeaderAuth in the original; add the matching Authorization header (or use the service's connector).",
        "\"Get Image Result URL\" polled the fal.ai queue; FAL_GET_REQUEST_RESULT waits for the request to finish and returns its result.",
        "\"Download Image\" sends its request body and reads the response as a file with yantra-storage HTTP_SEND (public https hosts only, 25 MB, 120 s).",
        "\"Google Drive\" uploads the file from \"Download Image\" to Google Drive (bytes or URL) with GOOGLESUPER_UPLOAD_FILE.",
